          "words": [
            "Söyle",
            "de",
            "bilelim"
          ],
          "distractors": [
            "Sen"
          ],
          "explanation": "A push: command + de + bilelim (“let us know”). The pronoun sen would turn de into “too.”"
        },
        {
          "translation": "You wait too.",
          "words": [
            "Sen",
            "de",
            "bekle"
          ],
          "distractors": [
            "da"
          ],
          "explanation": "“Too” goes at the end in English, but de goes right after sen. sen has the vowel e, so de."
        },
        {
          "translation": "Here, let me see.",
          "words": [
